  "description": "SchemaBridge.EF is a lightweight helper library for migrating data between databases\n            when splitting a monolithic system into microservices.\n\n            It provides a structured, resumable transfer pipeline based on Entity Framework,\n            including table transport, optional change-tracking via cache tables,\n            and post-transfer validation.\n\n            The library focuses on safe data migration without one-off scripts,\n            using explicit transporters and checkers instead.\n\n            9.0.0 – Initial release.",
